* CMOS VGA simulation with generic Level-1 MOS models.
.param vc=1.4862789322073584 cc=1 bias=1 cl=1 g1=8 g2=8 scale=4 rin=5000 amp=0.021875 freq=1000000.0 vdd=1.8 vcm=0.9 tdeg=27 dt=1 stop=40 kf=1e-25 ppd=120
.param KFL={kf}
.include ../../models/vga.lib
.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=15 reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-13 vntol=1e-8 chgtol=1e-20 trtol=1 method=trap
.temp {tdeg}
VDD VDD 0 {vdd}
VREF REF 0 {vcm}
VIN VIN 0 SINE({vcm} {amp/2} {freq}) AC 1
VC CTRL 0 {vc}
* Complementary control-gate driver is behavioural, no power/noise claim.
BCP CP 0 V=V(VDD)-V(CTRL)
XG VIN OUT CTRL CP REF VDD 0 VGA CC={cc*1p} BIAS={bias} CL={cl*1p} G1={g1} G2={g2} SCALE={scale} RIN={rin}
.tran 0 {stop*1u} 0 {dt*1n}
.save V(OUT) V(VIN) V(CTRL) V(xg:att) V(xg:mid) I(VDD) I(VREF) I(VC) I(BCP)
CDET OUT SENSE 10p
RDET SENSE 0 1Meg
.end
